    "body": "This is where the suggestion to use disclosure-open came from: https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/10380#issuecomment-2189397947\n\nI originally used \"foo\" instead of \"fake-counter-name\", which was recommended [here](https://chromium-review.git.corp.google.com/c/chromium/src/+/5660759/comment/9b101e55_1ccdf459/). I don't have an opinion on what the name should be.\n\n@dbaron ",
